#: includes/class-help.php:69
msgid "A temporary error is retried four times, after 1, 4, 9 and 16 minutes. After that the error is logged and emailed to the site admin address."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help.php:41
msgid "API token: create a team in pretix (Organizer → Teams) with an API token that may manage customer accounts and reusable media for the organizer, and view and change orders in the events used. Put the token in the PRETIX_SYNC_TOKEN constant in wp-config.php, an environment variable or a Docker secret; the settings field is only the last fallback and is stored in the database."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help.php:35
msgid "All work runs in the Action Scheduler queue (group pretix-sync). A temporary pretix outage is retried automatically; real errors go to the order notes, to the log (WooCommerce → Status → Logs, source pretix-sync) and by email to the site admin address."
msgstr ""

