#: includes/class-help.php:53
msgid "Order paid (status processing or completed): one pass is created per attendee, labelled with the name and the order number. With a Passes event and a pass item ID on the product, a free badge ticket is also created and linked to the pass. The badge text is the custom checkout field marked “Print on badge”."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help.php:68
