msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help.php:56
msgid "Pass-only tickets (staff whose pass is handed over at the venue): pass and badge only; no emails, no account, not even after registration opens."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help.php:46
msgid "Passes event slug (optional): a pretix event with one free pass ticket per attendee, used for badge printing (Badges → QR code: Reusable Medium ID). Set the matching pass item ID on each WooCommerce ticket product. Empty = no badge tickets."
msgstr ""

