#: includes/class-help.php:76
msgid "When a WooCommerce order is refunded or cancelled, the plugin undoes everything for its attendees, step by step: it cancels their session registrations (pretix emails the attendee about it) unless the same pretix account holds another valid ticket, invalidates the membership, cancels the badge and all-access tickets and deactivates the pass. A deactivated pass no longer opens any door. A failed step is retried and reported in the order notes."
